        .beekeeperLogCandleOut: "The candle gutters out.",
        .helpBeekeeperWorkbenchTitle: "🕯️ The Workbench & Wasps",
        .helpBeekeeperWorkbench: "After your 2nd comb, The Workbench opens. Make a beeswax candle from 10 wax. Once you've made 5 candles, the Hippies arrive: they give 1 sage for every 10 beeswax candles. Your first sage unlocks the sage repellent candle (10 wax + 1 sage).\n\nWasps start to come by too, but only while you're playing Beekeeper. When one arrives you have a minute to throw a shoe (it misses 4 times in 10), bribe it with a quarter of your honey, or light a repellent candle (no wasps for 15 minutes of play). If the wasp gets through, it helps itself to some honey. Bribe enough wasps and the wasp nest sends an emissary: the raids stop for good, repellent candles are no longer needed, and the wasps trade paper for honey (50 honey a sheet).\n\nOnce the poplar has sprouted, two more candles join The Workbench, made with propolis. The bee-boost candle makes more honey for a while, but only while you play. The sage-propolis candle makes a little more honey for hours and keeps burning while the app is closed.\n\nOnce The Workbench is open, the Beekeeper's Shop also sells upgrades: bigger combs, a better Wax-Catcher, stronger candles, and later a Third Bed, the Notebook and the Propolis Seal. Bought upgrades leave the Shop.",
