        .beekeeperLogCalmEnded: "The smoke drifts away.",
        .helpBeekeeperSmokerTitle: "💨 Catching More & the Smoker",
        .helpBeekeeperSmoker: "After the Bee-Safe Vacuum, the Shop sells more tools (Bee Lure, Flower Cart, Hive Whistle) and Practice upgrades that make every click catch more. Every catch also brings in a small slice of your hive (0.1% of your bees), so big hives grow faster (up to 10 times what your tool catches).\n\nThe Smoker, also in the Shop, fills a little with every click. When it's full, press Puff the Smoker: for 2 minutes the bees are calm and make double honey.",
