        .helpBeekeeperQueenTitle: "👑 The Queen & the Trade Agreement",
        .helpBeekeeperQueen: "When your bees move into the wooden hive, the queen settles in and starts to lay: she raises 20 new honeybees a minute, even while the app is closed. Every 100 bees she raises eat 1 bee bread, so keep the pantry stocked at The Workbench before you leave. When the bee bread runs out she simply rests until there is more; no bees are lost.\n\nAfter 100 trades, the bear offers a trade agreement: when your combs are full, he takes the honey that doesn't fit at half price (20 honey for 1 Beebit). Selling by hand still pays the full price.",
